        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: District heat, at consumer, heat from nuclear power plant, economic allocation
Inventory is valid for the district heat based on heat from nuclear power plant. Heat loss is 11% while heat transportation. For heat from nucelar power plant economic allocation was used.;
UUID: 3fac81fa-3ab3-33bc-90eb-ae19983ac3bf
Included is the infrastructure of the deliverysystem for district heat, the losses and the heat from nuclear power plant.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3fac81fa-3ab3-33bc-90eb-ae19983ac3bf.xml</text>
